    "detailed_description": "Welcome to KALEIDOLA, a third-person action puzzle game that takes you on a journey through a kaleidoscope-inspired world. Go on a mind-bending adventure that challenges players to think creatively and adapt to each new environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/7e72b12d20d08c577689a09520052a5c.poster.avif?t=1725021168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/7e72b12d20d08c577689a09520052a5c.webm?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/7e72b12d20d08c577689a09520052a5c.mp4?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >unleash Your Creativity</h2></h2>As you encounter roadblocks along the way, don't give up. Master the art of switching between 3D mode and Kaleidoscope mode to achieve your objectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/156dd09a82261fa4c88ba382d01753be.poster.avif?t=1725021168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/156dd09a82261fa4c88ba382d01753be.webm?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/156dd09a82261fa4c88ba382d01753be.mp4?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >kaleidoscope Mode</h2></h2>Unlock KALEIDOLA's power when a flashing object is on screen. With a simple press of a button, take control and watch the creativity unfold. Transform objects, paths, and obstacles to overcome any dead-ends that seem impossible to pass.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/af63087fe961cc549b0aab4bad32383f.poster.avif?t=1725021168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/af63087fe961cc549b0aab4bad32383f.webm?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/af63087fe961cc549b0aab4bad32383f.mp4?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >designed With Passion</h2></h2>KALEIDOLA is a testament to the love and creativity of indie developer, HAYATOSKIE. Immerse yourself in their colourful world, where every twist and turn reveals their commitment to puzzle innovation and originality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/77867e28582e1e1386e9f7ba57d5a7f7.poster.avif?t=1725021168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/77867e28582e1e1386e9f7ba57d5a7f7.webm?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529140/extras/77867e28582e1e1386e9f7ba57d5a7f7.mp4?t=1725021168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
